.kujolang.ai/assets/deck/social/presenter.e95c913411af.png"><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="KUJO — Presenter console. Present the Kujo investor briefing."></head><body><a class="p-skip" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main id="main-content" class="p-presenter sk-container" data-deck="kujo-investor" data-count="18"><h1>Presenter console</h1><p>Share the audience window only. Notes stay in this window and are never sent to the audience.</p><nav aria-label="Presenter controls"><button data-previous>Previous</button><button data-next>Next</button><button data-audience>Open audience</button><label>Slide <input data-slide type="number" min="1" max="18" value="1"></label><output data-position aria-live="polite">1</output></nav><div class="p-presenter-frames"><div aria-label="Current slide preview" aria-hidden="true" data-current></div><div aria-label="Next slide preview" aria-hidden="true" data-upcoming></div></div><section><h2>Private speaker notes</h2><label>Load local notes JSON <input data-notes-file type="file" accept="application/json,.json"></label><button data-clear>Clear notes</button><p data-notes-status role="status"></p><pre data-notes></pre></section><section><h2>Elapsed time</h2><output data-timer>00:00</output><button data-timer-toggle>Start timer</button><button data-timer-reset>Reset timer</button></section></main><script src="/assets/presentation/presenter.js" defer></script><script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/vce701823e78c4301a35b7e07294d87301792088814092" integrity="sha512-UKNk8GbxkABxKcXYuLkO16EleLGUkcvJWtpSNmExE0Too3ZaFAxTscNWEc1OdAv5/BikHawapSCaiD2XCmp+Bw==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"1d30a17a0e01472db240809ad42c0b1f","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
